tick=9 note the restarted runner dies again and the kubelet backs off, so the crash loop counts one failed attempt on the revision's ladder and the block enters Backoff; the second Instance's attempt, opened before this failure, is re-stamped on the same pass and leaves the block in Backoff
tick=9 apply pod.containersNotReady pod=svc-a-engine-0-default-1 now=t+20s
